  "markdown": "<figure type=\"ILLUSTRATION\">Social Security Administration\nBenefit Verification Letter\n\n\n<description>A circular black and white seal of the U.S. Social Security Administration on the left, featuring an eagle with spread wings on top of a shield with vertical stripes, with the text \"SOCIAL SECURITY\" around the upper arc and \"ADMINISTRATION\" around the lower arc, and \"USA\" in the center. To the right of the seal is the title text \"Social Security Administration\" in a serif font, with \"Benefit Verification Letter\" in bold serif font beneath it. A partial letter \"D\" is visible at the far right edge.</description></figure>\n\n- **Date**: April 16, 2026<br>- **BNC#**: 98AW400G04124<br>- **REF**: A\n\nJANE SAMPLE\n100 MAIN ST\n101\nANYTOWN PR  00999\n\nYou asked us for information from your record. The information that you requested is shown below. If you want anyone else to have this information, you may send them this letter.\n\n## Information About Current Social Security Benefits\n\nBeginning December 2025, the full monthly Social Security benefit before any deductions is $1,137.30.\n\nWe deduct $81.90 for medical insurance premiums each month.\n\nThe regular monthly Social Security payment is $1,055.00. (We must round down to the whole dollar.)\n\nSocial Security benefits for a given month are paid the following month. (For example, Social Security benefits for March are paid in April.)\n\nYour Social Security benefits are paid on or about the fourth Wednesday of each month.\n\nWe found that you became disabled under our rules on December 31, 2021.\n\n# Information About Past Social Security Benefits\n\nFrom July 2025 to November 2025, the full monthly Social Security benefit before any deductions was $1,106.40.\n\nWe deducted $65.00 for medical insurance premiums each month.\n\nThe regular monthly Social Security payment was $1,041.00. (We must round down to the whole dollar.)\n\n**Type of Social Security Benefit Information**\n\nYou are entitled to monthly disability benefits.\n\nSee Next Page\n\n<!-- PAGE BREAK -->\n\n98AW400G04124\n\nPage 2 of 2\n\n## Medicare Information\n\nYou are entitled to hospital insurance under Medicare beginning August 2025.\n\nYou are entitled to medical insurance under Medicare beginning August 2025.\n\nYour Medicare number is 1UX3VM6MM52 . You may use this number to get medical services while waiting for your Medicare card.\n\nIf you have any questions, please log into Medicare.gov, or call 1-800-MEDICARE (1-800-633-4227).\n\n**Date of Birth Information**\n\nThe date of birth shown on our records is November 14, 1981 .\n\n**Suspect Social Security Fraud?**\n\nPlease visit http://oig.ssa.gov/r or call the Inspector General's Fraud Hotline at 1-800-269-0271 (TTY 1-866-501-2101).\n\n## If You Have Questions\n\n**Need more help?**\n\n1. Visit www.ssa.gov for fast, simple and secure online service.\n2. Call us at **1-800-772-1213**, weekdays from 8:00 am to 7:00 pm. If you are deaf or hard of hearing, call TTY **1-800-325-0778**. Please mention this letter when you call.\n3. You may also call your local office at **1-833-882-1202**.\n\nSOCIAL SECURITY\nESCORIAL SHOPPING CT\n5829 AVE 65INF STE 201\nCAROLINA PR 00987\n\nSocial Security Administration\n\n<!-- doc_id=parse-01m7rvqb54hph5c95gn8mgz2ex -->",
